---
// 摄影优先图库：按视角语义分组（隐藏空组）、精选/全部两层、Lightbox 可溯源到媒体详情。
import type { PublicMedia } from '../lib/privacy';
import { VIEW_TYPE_ZH, LICENSE_ZH } from '../lib/labels';

interface Props {
  media: PublicMedia[];
  /** 精选数量：超过则默认折叠，提供「查看全部影像」；不传则全部展示 */
  curatedLimit?: number;
}

const { media, curatedLimit } = Astro.props;

type GroupKey = 'LIVE' | 'BEHAVIOR' | 'HABITAT' | 'SPECIMEN' | 'OTHER';
const GROUP_LABELS: Record<GroupKey, string> = {
  LIVE: '活体',
  BEHAVIOR: '行为',
  HABITAT: '生境',
  SPECIMEN: '标本与镜检',
  OTHER: '其他',
};
function groupOf(viewType: string): GroupKey {
  if (viewType.startsWith('live_')) return 'LIVE';
  if (viewType === 'behavior') return 'BEHAVIOR';
  if (viewType === 'habitat') return 'HABITAT';
  if (['specimen_dorsal', 'specimen_ventral', 'male_palp', 'epigyne', 'vulva', 'microscopy'].includes(viewType)) return 'SPECIMEN';
  return 'OTHER';
}

const items = media.map((m) => ({
  ...m,
  vtLabel: VIEW_TYPE_ZH[m.view_type] ?? m.view_type,
  licenseLabel: LICENSE_ZH[m.license as keyof typeof LICENSE_ZH] ?? '',
  group: groupOf(m.view_type),
}));

const groups: { key: GroupKey; label: string; items: typeof items }[] = [];
for (const g of ['LIVE', 'BEHAVIOR', 'HABITAT', 'SPECIMEN', 'OTHER'] as GroupKey[]) {
  const list = items.filter((i) => i.group === g);
  if (list.length > 0) groups.push({ key: g, label: GROUP_LABELS[g], items: list });
}
const showGroupLabels = groups.length > 1;
const limit = curatedLimit ?? items.length;
const hasMore = items.length > limit;
---

<div class="media-archive" data-limit={limit}>
  {groups.map((g) => (
    <div class="media-group">
      {showGroupLabels && <div class="media-group-label">{g.label}</div>}
      <div class="gallery">
        {g.items.map((m) => {
          const flatIndex = items.indexOf(m);
          return (
            <figure
              class:list={[{ 'is-extra': flatIndex >= limit }]}
              data-index={flatIndex}
              data-large={m.large}
              data-caption={m.caption ?? ''}
              data-photographer={m.photographer}
              data-public-id={m.public_id}
              data-detail={m.detail_url}
              tabindex="0"
              role="button"
              aria-label={`查看大图：${m.caption ?? m.vtLabel}（${m.public_id}）`}
            >
              <img src={m.medium} alt={m.caption ?? m.vtLabel} loading="lazy" width={m.width} height={m.height} />
              <span class="vt">{m.vtLabel}</span>
              <figcaption>
                {m.caption}
                <span class="who">© {m.photographer}{m.licenseLabel === '版权所有' ? '' : ` · ${m.licenseLabel}`}</span>
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
          );
        })}
      </div>
    </div>
  ))}

  {hasMore && (
    <button class="show-all" type="button">
      查看全部影像（共 {items.length} 张）
    </button>
  )}
</div>

<div class="lightbox" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="图片灯箱">
  <button class="close" type="button" aria-label="关闭">×</button>
  <button class="prev" type="button" aria-label="上一张">‹</button>
  <img alt="" />
  <div class="cap">
    <span class="text"></span>
    <span class="who"></span>
    <span class="ref"></span>
  </div>
  <button class="next" type="button" aria-label="下一张">›</button>
</div>

<script>
  // 生命周期：astro:page-load 在首次加载与每次客户端导航后触发；
  // 事件委托 + 模块级状态只注册一次，导航越多不会累积监听。
  let activeBox: HTMLElement | null = null;
  let activeIndex = 0;
  let activeFigures: HTMLElement[] = [];

  function show(i: number) {
    if (!activeBox) return;
    activeIndex = (i + activeFigures.length) % activeFigures.length;
    const f = activeFigures[activeIndex];
    const img = activeBox.querySelector('img')!;
    img.src = f.dataset.large ?? '';
    img.alt = f.dataset.caption ?? '';
    activeBox.querySelector('.cap .text')!.textContent = f.dataset.caption ?? '';
    activeBox.querySelector('.cap .who')!.textContent = '© ' + (f.dataset.photographer ?? '');
    const ref = activeBox.querySelector('.cap .ref')!;
    ref.replaceChildren();
    const code = document.createElement('span');
    code.textContent = f.dataset.publicId ?? '';
    const link = document.createElement('a');
    link.href = f.dataset.detail ?? '';
    link.textContent = '影像详情 →';
    ref.append(code, link);
  }
  function openBox(box: HTMLElement, figures: HTMLElement[], i: number) {
    activeBox = box;
    activeFigures = figures;
    show(i);
    box.classList.add('open');
    document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
    box.querySelector('.close')?.focus();
  }
  function closeBox() {
    if (!activeBox) return;
    activeBox.classList.remove('open');
    document.body.style.overflow = '';
    activeBox = null;
  }

  document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
    const t = e.target as HTMLElement;
    if (activeBox) {
      if (t.closest('.lightbox .close') || e.target === activeBox) return closeBox();
      if (t.closest('.lightbox .prev')) return show(activeIndex - 1);
      if (t.closest('.lightbox .next')) return show(activeIndex + 1);
      return;
    }
    const fig = t.closest<HTMLElement>('figure[data-large]');
    const gallery = fig?.closest<HTMLElement>('.media-archive');
    const box = gallery?.parentElement?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.lightbox');
    if (fig && box) {
      const figures = Array.from(gallery.querySelectorAll('figure'));
      openBox(box, figures, Number(fig.dataset.index));
    }
  });
  document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if (!activeBox) return;
    if (e.key === 'Escape') closeBox();
    else if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') show(activeIndex - 1);
    else if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') show(activeIndex + 1);
  });

  function initGalleries() {
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.media-archive').forEach((archive) => {
      if (archive.dataset.galleryInit === '1') return;
      archive.dataset.galleryInit = '1';
      const showAllBtn = archive.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.show-all');
      showAllBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        archive.classList.add('show-all-enabled');
        showAllBtn.remove();
      });
      archive.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('figure').forEach((f) => {
        f.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
          if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') {
            e.preventDefault();
            f.click();
          }
        });
      });
    });
  }
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initGalleries);
</script>

<style>
  .who { display: block; color: var(--faint); font-size: 12px; margin-top: 2px; }
  .ref { display: block; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
  .ref :global(a) { color: #d8d3c7; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; margin-left: 10px; }
  .media-group-label {
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: var(--faint);
    margin: 18px 0 10px;
  }
  .show-all {
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 13.5px; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    background: none; border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted);
    padding: 9px 20px; cursor: pointer; margin: 4px 0 24px; transition: border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .show-all:hover { border-color: var(--faint); color: var(--ink); }
  figure.is-extra { display: none; }
  .show-all-enabled figure.is-extra { display: block; }
  .show-all-enabled + .lightbox .show-all, .media-archive.show-all-enabled .show-all { display: none; }
</style>
